entially some form of technological  advancement and one of the funny things  that he asked and she really expected  him to ask this was you know like don't  you think this is a little bit risky for  us to be playing god and she said well  if you want to go down that path then  the logic applies that god created a  species capable of playing god so if  anything if god exists and we're capable  of doing this it's because god wanted us  to and so it's one of those things where  it's kind of like assuaging his concerns  in that way and the two of them  basically continue on now at that point  we basically switch back to omega  wolverine who of course is still in the  the whole facility and fighting the  various members of the cia and so on and  so forth and basically overtakes them  but then suddenly he's met by laura  kinney and scout and then of course  dakin his biological son like the the  son of wolverine and that's when he  really like starts talking and actually  having conversations with him that was  one of the elements of the mystery and  intrigue surrounding this guy is is he  just like some kind of phalanx like  robot right some kind of automaton where  he just goes into the past executes a  series of commands goes back to the  present and then like that's basically  it or back to the future rather and  that's basically it really like  incapable of speech or anything along  those lines no like that's the thing  like we didn't really know what the  whole deal with this guy was dicken  confirms it dickens like i can tell by  your scent i can tell by the way you  fight i can tell by the way you talk it  really is you and that's when he's like  we're here to bring you in like we're  here to stop you but one of the things  he says is like i know how all of you  die i know exactly how every single one  of you died none of you make it like  none of you guys make it to the end you  are executed like you are killed now we  don't know exactly how they die we  suddenl